 "review": {
  "score": 5.0,
  "round": 1,
  "problems": [
   "Scale is wrong. In the 'next to a person' panel the kelp's top is level with the man's head, so it is about one person tall. The brief asks for two people tall (spec h 4.3).",
   "In the scene the stalks are thin and read as a scraggly weed or a dead bush, not as a big kelp stand. The fronds are small next to the stems, so the cluster looks sparse.",
   "The charcoal reef rock base (y 0 to -42) is tiny and nearly hidden under the stems. In the scene the plant looks like it stands on nothing.",
   "All three stems start within 16 units of each other and fan out in a narrow V. The silhouette is a thin wisp with no clear tall column shape.",
   "The brass float bulbs (r 5-6) are almost invisible at scene scale. They read as stray specks, not kelp floats."
  ]
 },
 "for": "tall swaying kelp fronds about two people tall",
 "source": "minted",
 "created": "2026-11-02",
 "sprite": {
  "w": 201.6,
