 },
 "sprite_review": {
  "score": 6.0,
  "problems": [
   "Scale is wrong: next to the person the kelp is only about 1.3 person-heights tall (about 140 px against a 105 px person), but it should be about two people tall.",
   "The silhouette is short and bushy, so at a glance it reads more like a tuft of grass, wheat or a houseplant than tall giant kelp. The fronds fan out from one point just above the rock and stop early, instead of rising in long ribbon-like stipes.",
   "The rock is wide compared with the plant. It takes up about a quarter of the sprite's height, which drags the eye down and makes the kelp look stubby.",
   "There are no floats (the small gas bladders at the base of each blade), so one key giant-kelp feature is missing."
  ]
 }
}